    "note": "Enrolled (Senate Substitute for HB 2278); House final action 2017-02-23, 125-0. Section 2(j) now exempts only postsecondary institutions (until July 1, 2017); the medical, adult care, mental health and indigent clinic list was struck from (j) and moved into (k), which says section 2 does not apply to those facilities (so carry cannot be restricted there). Section 2(k) items 2-5 quoted from the new list."
